---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ArticleCard from '../components/ArticleCard.astro';
import { getArticles } from '../lib/articles';
const latest = (await getArticles()).slice(0, 3);
---
<Base>
<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>We focus on the bottlenecks choking your growth, while you focus on running the business.</h1>
      <div class="hero-row">
        <p class="sub">Whether your bottlenecks and blockers sit in revenue, finance, support, development, fulfilment or anywhere in between, we take ownership of the systems and processes that keep your operations running. We look at how each part of the business connects, fix the places where work gets stuck, and work with your team until the change sticks.</p>
        <div>
          <p class="strip">For growing SaaS and tech companies. Sales, onboarding, billing, support and more.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="/contact/" data-open>Book a free 30-minute call</a><a class="lnk" href="#how">See how we work</a>
          <p class="note">On the call we look at how work moves through your business, and you leave with the three bottlenecks we would fix first.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </main>

<section class="sec"><div class="wrap split">
  <h2>The systems that got you started can’t keep up with growth</h2><div>
  <p class="body">The processes you built as a startup worked when you had a handful of staff and customers, but as you scale, those same processes start to break. You probably notice it in the frustrations across the business that keep adding up:</p>
  <ul class="body plist">
    <li>Leads not handled with the urgency you expect</li>
    <li>Cluttered sales pipelines with poor conversion rates</li>
    <li>Reporting that has no connection to the reality of your P&amp;L</li>
    <li>Decisions and approvals that keep waiting on you</li>
    <li>New customers taking longer and longer to go live</li>
    <li>Support tickets taking longer and longer to resolve</li>
    <li>Customer satisfaction scores steadily trending down</li>
    <li>New hires learning the job by asking whoever has been there longest</li>
    <li>Automations and AI builds becoming disconnected islands in the business</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="body">I’m sure you could add a few of your own. Together, these issues start to block your business’s growth.</p>
  <p class="body">The difficulty is that your staff are busy keeping the wheels turning, nobody has the time to focus on solving the root causes, and those who could only see their own part of the bigger picture.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="wrap">
      <div class="flow">
        <p class="ft">Where growth gets blocked in a SaaS business</p>
        <ul class="fl"><li><i class="sw on"></i>What gets through today</li><li><i class="sw off"></i>What your growth could be</li><li><i class="sw bk"></i>A blocker</li></ul>
