le class="mk" cx="780" cy="100" r="14"/><text class="mn" x="780" y="100" dy=".35em">5</text><circle class="mk" cx="953.3" cy="100" r="14"/><text class="mn" x="953.3" y="100" dy=".35em">6</text><circle class="sd" cx="4" cy="204" r="4"/><text class="sn" x="0" y="228" text-anchor="start">Lead</text><circle class="sd" cx="173.3" cy="204" r="4"/><text class="sn" x="173.3" y="228" text-anchor="middle">Signed deal</text><circle class="sd" cx="346.7" cy="204" r="4"/><text class="sn" x="346.7" y="228" text-anchor="middle">Onboarding</text><circle class="sd" cx="520" cy="204" r="4"/><text class="sn" x="520" y="228" text-anchor="middle">Live</text><circle class="sd" cx="693.3" cy="204" r="4"/><text class="sn" x="693.3" y="228" text-anchor="middle">Billing</text><circle class="sd" cx="866.7" cy="204" r="4"/><text class="sn" x="866.7" y="228" text-anchor="middle">Support</text><circle class="sd" cx="1036" cy="204" r="4"/><text class="sn" x="1040" y="228" text-anchor="end">Renewal</text></svg><ol class="co"><li><span class="bn">1</span><b>Approvals</b>Pricing and sign-offs still wait on the founder, so deals stall.</li><li><span class="bn">2</span><b>Deal handover</b>What sales promised never reaches the onboarding team.</li><li><span class="bn">3</span><b>Go-live</b>Only one person knows how to set a customer up, so go-live takes weeks.</li><li><span class="bn">4</span><b>Billing</b>What was agreed in the CRM does not match what gets invoiced.</li><li><span class="bn">5</span><b>Support</b>Problems bounce between support and developers, and nobody owns them.</li><li><span class="bn">6</span><b>Renewals</b>An unhappy customer is noticed too late to keep them.</li></ol></div>
