ria-hidden="true"><path class="gh0" d="M12.3 0 L10.3 132 L109.7 132 L107.7 0 Z"/><path class="gl" d="M12.3 0 L10.3 132 M107.7 0 L109.7 132"/><path class="ac" d="M29.9 0 L29.9 14 C29.9 40 47 40 47 66 C47 92 34.1 92 34.1 118 L34.1 132 L85.9 132 L85.9 118 C85.9 92 73 92 73 66 C73 40 90.1 40 90.1 14 L90.1 0 Z"/><circle class="mk" cx="60" cy="66" r="14"/><text class="mn" x="60" y="66" dy=".35em">3</text></svg><span class="gt"><b>Go-live</b>Only one person knows how to set a customer up, so go-live takes weeks.</span></li><li class="fn"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 38" aria-hidden="true"><path class="gh0" d="M10.3 0 L9.7 38 L110.3 38 L109.7 0 Z"/><path class="gl" d="M10.3 0 L9.7 38 M109.7 0 L110.3 38"/><rect class="ac" x="34.1" y="0" width="51.8" height="38"/></svg><span class="sl">Live</span></li><li class="fg"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 132" aria-hidden="true"><path class="gh0" d="M9.7 0 L7.7 132 L112.3 132 L110.3 0 Z"/><path class="gl" d="M9.7 0 L7.7 132 M110.3 0 L112.3 132"/><path class="ac" d="M34.1 0 L34.1 14 C34.1 40 49 40 49 66 C49 92 38 92 38 118 L38 132 L82 132 L82 118 C82 92 71 92 71 66 C71 40 85.9 40 85.9 14 L85.9 0 Z"/><circle class="mk" cx="60" cy="66" r="14"/><text class="mn" x="60" y="66" dy=".35em">4</text></svg><span class="gt"><b>Billing</b>What was agreed in the CRM does not match what gets invoiced.</span></li><li class="fn"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 38" aria-hidden="true"><path class="gh0" d="M7.7 0 L7.1 38 L112.9 38 L112.3 0 Z"/><path class="gl" d="M7.7 0 L7.1 38 M112.3 0 L112.9 38"/><rect class="ac" x="38" y="0" width="44.1" height="38"/></svg><span class="sl">Billing</span></li><li class="fg"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 132" aria-hidden="true"><path class="gh0" d="M7.1 0 L5.1 132 L114.9 132 L112.9 0 Z"/><path class="gl" d="M7.1 0 L5.1 132 M112.9 0 L114.9 132"/><path class="ac" d="M38 0 L38 14 C38 40 50.5 40 50.5 66 C50.5 92 41.1 92 41.1 118 L41.1 132 L78.9 132 L78.9 118 C78.9 92 69.5 92 69.5 66 C69.5 40 82 40 82 14 L82 0 Z"/><circle class="mk" cx="60" cy="66" r="14"/><